/target
# Standalone build artifacts of the archived spikes crate (task 5.1).
.archive/spikes/target/
*.rs.bk

# knowledge.db fixture binary (2.2 MB) is gitignored; provenance and the
# regeneration command live in fixtures/README.md, which stays tracked.
fixtures/*
!fixtures/README.md

# Runtime artifacts downloaded per ../synopsis/configs/onnx.yaml (task 2.1):
# ONNX Runtime .so (~24 MB) + bge-m3-int8 model files (~2.3 GB). Preloaded from the
# oracle's own data/ copy; provenance and verification live in data/README.md, which stays tracked.
data/*
!data/README.md

# Cargo.lock is committed on purpose: this workspace produces a binary and
# reproducible builds matter for parity testing against the Go oracle.
